## Overview

Prices are in euros. The [limits](#limits) apply to every plan, and :ref[IR1] to every refund.

## Limits {#limits}

:::requirement{#IR1} A refund needs the order number
See [the overview](#overview) and the [nested contract](nested-a.smd#contract).
:::

:::requirement{#IR2 applies-to=IR1} Refunds over 500 euros need a second approval
:::

